    "title": "What will Rosstat report as Russia's average retail price of AI-95 gasoline in the weekly fuel-price release covering data through mid-October 2026?",
    "description": "[stripped for the M1-364 fixture: not read by the grid refusal]",
    "resolution_criteria": "This question resolves to the national average retail consumer price of AI-95 gasoline (автомобильный бензин марки АИ-95) in the Russian Federation, in rubles per liter, as reported in the Russian Federal State Statistics Service (Rosstat) weekly monitoring of consumer prices for petroleum products whose reference date is the Monday closest to but not after October 15, 2026 (i.e. the weekly release reporting prices as of October 12, 2026). The figure is published by Rosstat in its \"Цены, инфляция\" section at https://rosstat.gov.ru/statistics/price and is routinely reported by [credible sources](https://www.metaculus.com/faq/#definitions) citing Rosstat. A reported value of 81.25 rubles per liter resolves as 81.25.",
